; ==========================================
; CHALLENGE 2: Rocket Launch Countdown
; Language: Marathi / मराठी (mr)
; ==========================================
; Count down from 5 to 1, then launch!

हलवा counter 5

launch_loop:
सिस्टम_कॉल counter
वजा counter 1
तुलना counter 0
if_different launch_loop

; Blastoff!
हलवा box 999
सिस्टम_कॉल box
